// 293: PARTES ACORDADAS. Each open operation keeps the amount agreed for it (monto_acordado_gyd) while it holds no money and, once it holds money,
// the last amount agreed before the deposit (dinero_gyd is the money). Facts only: which parts the registered deposit covers whole (in the order
